## Change safety (mechanical)

Default to **minimal diffs**. Run before commit / `@code-implementation complete`:

| Gate | Command | Fail when |
|------|---------|-----------|
| Touch scope | `bash /mnt/work/Projects/.ai/scripts/touch-scope-verify.sh` | File outside `.work/touch-scope` or iteration **Files** |
| Blast radius | `bash /mnt/work/Projects/.ai/scripts/blast-radius-check.sh` | `risk: high` (cross-area or oversized diff) |
| Protected surfaces | `.work/PROTECTED_SURFACES.json` + §Protected Files | High-blast path without owner approval |
| Tests | `bash bin/test.sh` (smoke; stack up) or per-service `docker compose exec back-api bash -c "cd /app && pytest tests/ -q"` | Non-zero exit |

**Declare scope first:** copy `/mnt/work/Projects/.ai/templates/work/touch-scope.template` → `.work/touch-scope`, or `@code-implementation plan` with **Files** per task. **MOD-06** required for agent-authored code (`/mnt/work/Projects/.ai/concepts/README.md` § Trigger table); `human-only` opt-out only when the human declares it in the same message. **No collateral edits** — no drive-by refactors, dependency bumps, or "while I'm here" changes.

