- **Framework** (`$AGENT_OS_SOURCE`, `$AI_UI_SOURCE`): skills, standards, concepts, guides — never vendored here.
- **Project** (`.work/`, `.work.ui/`): plans, SPECs, HANDOFF, touch-scope, integration cache. Map: `.work/README.md` · `.work.ui/README.md`.

