**Lost on UI?** `$AI_UI_SOURCE/START_HERE.md` · **Router:** `@ui-process-router - <question>` · **Free-text:** `@ui-director - <describe what you want>`

### Change safety (UI — add to gate table above)

| Gate | Command | Fail when |
|------|---------|-----------|
| Touch scope | `bash /mnt/work/Projects/.ai.ui/scripts/touch-scope-verify.sh` | File outside `.work.ui/touch-scope` |
